<title>USA: NCR, Lucent in call center deal.</title>
<headline>NCR, Lucent in call center deal.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>NCR Corp and Lucent Technologies Inc said on Monday they have agreed to deliver computer/telephony integration (CTI) solutions for call centers.</p>
<p>The companies plan to provide telecommunications and computer services and equipment for customer service operations in retail, financial services and communications companies, as well as government agencies, NCR and Lucent said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>NCR and Lucent were formerly units of AT&amp;T Corp.</p>
